The lengths of the legs of the right triangle shown below are given in inches. What is the area, in square inches, of the triangle?

\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw (0,0) -- (4,0) -- (4,3) -- cycle;
\draw (3.7,0) -- (3.7,0.3) -- (4,0.3);
\node at (2,-0.3) {4};
\node at (4.3,1.5) {6};
\end{tikzpicture}

(Note: The area of a triangle with base $b$ and height $h$ is $\frac{1}{2}bh$.)
